WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:04,260
Oops, what is this? Have you seen it?

2
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:05,260
Just leave her on the ground?

3
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:07,260
Do you want to put her on the sofa?

4
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:16,230
Okay, sister, let’s try it together

5
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:18,230
You and Ji Chuan collected supplies for a day, right?

6
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:20,230
There is a bed upstairs. You can go and rest. I will keep watch.

7
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:22,230
Obviously I've slept a lot for a few days and I'm not sleepy.

8
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:24,420
What is your artistic ability?

9
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,420
I have no artistic ability

10
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,420
How come? Everyone has artistic skills

11
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:28,420
Everyone I've ever met has

12
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:30,510
Maybe your talent is just not easy to discover

13
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:32,510
Sister, I'm not sleepy. I can stay awake all night.

14
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:34,510
Brother Ji Chuan saved me twice during the day

15
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:36,510
I should protect him this time. I owe him

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:38,510
It’s been a long time since a girl chatted with me like this

17
00:00:38,510 --> 00:00:40,510
In the end I thought he was his girlfriend

18
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:42,510
I wish I had artistic skills

19
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:45,510
This way I can look for supplies with you.
